## Description ##
## Job Purpose ##
We are looking for an IT Senior System Specialist to maintain and improve our Guest processes, Onboard platforms and their integrated systems.
He/She will take care of our Onboard platform in Data Configuration, Operational Reporting, Analysis, Troubleshooting and Support for onboard business such as: Onboard Finance, Shorex, Guest, Crew, Safety, Security, Housekeeping, F&B, SPA, etc.
The Senior System Specialist oversees and maintains production and testing systems; schedules legacy systems operations; monitors output and report distribution, performs a variety of tasks relative to assigned areas of responsibility collaborating with Corporate, Managers and other IT Specialists.
## Key Accountabilities ##
* Analysis and elicitation of functional and non-functional requirements for Onboard platforms and their integrated systems.
* Gives support in planning, managing and delivering Onboard platforms and their integrated systems;
* Gives support in defining solutions aligned to business requirements;
* Ensure and overseeing all systems setting activities related to new buildings operations;
* Supports business for the updating, testing and measurement of the products evolution added to the systems;
* Set ups and update the PMS onboard through a steady maintenance interdepartmentally (Guest and Crew Service, Excursion, Spa, Finance, Retail, F&B, Dining, Safety and Security);
* Provides assistance and advice to the on-board departments involved in PMS settings;

* Experience in Cruise Industry (focus on Hotel Operations);
* At least 3 years- hands-on experience in similar roles or equivalent experiences with IT Applications for Cruise Lines;
* Working knowledges of onboard PMS Systems and Ship Warehouse process (Otalio SPMS, Oracle SPMS, Oracle MMS, Crunchtime or similar);
* Oracle, SQL/MySQL database Language skills;
* Knowledge of programming languages for operational reporting (e.g., JasperReports)
* Knowledge of programming languages (Python, JavaScript or similar) is a plus;
* Knowledge of Automation and Reporting Tools (PowerAutomate, PowerBi, PowerApp) is a plus;
* Ability to manage priorities and meet deadlines in a timely manner;
* Good inter-personal and communication skills;
* Good organizational, problem-solving, and analytical skills;
* Versatility, flexibility and a willingness to work in a dynamic environment;
* Availability to travel and outside region residencies;
* Bachelor's degree required in Engineering, Computer Science (or equivalent);
* Fluent English and Italian. (spoken and written)

* A challenging position in an open and dynamic midsized employer within an international environment;
* Competitive compensation with great working conditions in a modern and innovative high-tech company;
* A long-term commitment and the opportunity to develop a rewarding career.

* Lead the conceptual design phase to select the machine-s architecture; influence the development team and prove that the solution will meet the requirements;
* Define the qualifications plan of the prototype; run the testing and analyze the results; present and commission the product at customers- facilities;
* Participate in activities of products- sustaining; define the production tests and their acceptance criteria;
* Strong expertise with concrete achievements in servo regulation for motion control, mechatronics engineering; knowledge of metrology and optics is an asset;
* Define project scope, deliverables and acceptance criteria;
* Follow up and technical guidance of the development team to ensure accurate, efficient and timely achievement of the defined development objectives.
##### Your profile #####
* Master degree in control or mechatronics engineering;
* Ideally 5 years in a similar position;
* Strong understanding of physical phenomena (e.g. mechanical and electronics coupling, vibration dynamics, thermo-mechanics);
* Proficient with MATLAB/SIMULINK;
* Good knowledge of real-time applications and programming languages: C, C++;
* Strong understanding of dynamic systems control;
* Autonomous, Team work ability; Strong analytical thinking;
* Good communication skills, fluent in English (able to be exposed to the worldwide customers).
